flowchart TB
  SCM[Windows Service Control Manager] --> SUP[CivicCastSupervisor service]
  SUP --> PG[Postgres database]
  SUP --> CP[Control plane, port 8000]
  SUP -.-> OL[Ollama, port 11434]
  CP --> PLAY[Playout workers]
  CP --> TSR[TS relay]
  CP --> HLS[HLS relay]
  CP --> CAP[Caption tap]
  PLAY --> ENG[GStreamer or ffmpeg]
